{"id": "d954aab42411cd3c11300622691a48c6dde9121cf5a0bc3e8946bd4c05900f8b", "original": "아니,/20d 슬프지 않아요.", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "不，/20d我并不伤心。", "object_name": "art_ko_flmma21c", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-c86448dee009bfdefa236923310b57ad", "object_id": -6378452956437020465, "path": ["TextList", 16, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 8, "changes", 42, "ops", 16, "value"], "target": "No,/20d I am not sad.", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Exact Korean reuse; Korean and Chinese context checked for this occurrence."]}
{"id": "3aeb507948e4990e14d4311d420b1e756d58ff695aebf00abe009f565ef33308", "original": "할아버지께 진정한 평화를 드릴 수 있게 되어 기뻐요...", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "能让外公得到真正的安宁，我很高兴……", "object_name": "art_ko_flmma21c", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-c86448dee009bfdefa236923310b57ad", "object_id": -6378452956437020465, "path": ["TextList", 17, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 8, "changes", 42, "ops", 17, "value"], "target": "I am glad Grandfather can finally be at peace...", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Exact Korean reuse; Korean and Chinese context checked for this occurrence."]}
{"id": "c7ab7f33307636e899c39b20e3c73c5803ba5423c8a55ff8384fd6508c06df88", "original": "이제... 아버지와 어머니도 편히 잠드실 수 있을 거예요.", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "现在……父亲和母亲也终于能够安息了。", "object_name": "art_ko_flmma21c", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-c86448dee009bfdefa236923310b57ad", "object_id": -6378452956437020465, "path": ["TextList", 18, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 8, "changes", 42, "ops", 18, "value"], "target": "Now... Father and Mother can rest in peace, too.", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Exact Korean reuse; Korean and Chinese context checked for this occurrence."]}
{"id": "41a33d816170563cd22a3bb30dcb25e51feb2829dbf85748e65bfae406014fa7", "original": "그리고.../30d 시라노 씨도...", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "还有……/30d西拉诺先生……", "object_name": "art_ko_flmma21c", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-c86448dee009bfdefa236923310b57ad", "object_id": -6378452956437020465, "path": ["TextList", 19, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 8, "changes", 42, "ops", 19, "value"], "target": "And.../30d so can you, Cyrano...", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Exact Korean reuse; Korean and Chinese context checked for this occurrence."]}
{"id": "be4329b46f31048b1900c0221885116e15afb21c8f1a1f5e6c1928cead5ab3ef", "original": "그러고 보니, 마키아벨린가 하는 그 녀석은 어디 갔지?", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "说起来，那个叫马基雅维利的家伙去哪儿了？", "object_name": "art_ko_flmma21c", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-c86448dee009bfdefa236923310b57ad", "object_id": -6378452956437020465, "path": ["TextList", 20, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 8, "changes", 42, "ops", 20, "value"], "target": "Come to think of it, where did that Machiavelli fellow go?", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Exact Korean reuse; Korean and Chinese context checked for this occurrence."]}
{"id": "699cd14d6488be71a67c786a36927912a794aa5dd3171399d181e7856f5374db", "original": "난 여기 있소. 도망가지 않을테니 걱정 할 필요는 없소.", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "我在这里。我不会逃跑，不必担心。", "object_name": "art_ko_flmma21c", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-c86448dee009bfdefa236923310b57ad", "object_id": -6378452956437020465, "path": ["TextList", 21, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 8, "changes", 42, "ops", 21, "value"], "target": "I am here. I will not flee, so there is no need to worry.", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Exact Korean reuse; Korean and Chinese context checked for this occurrence."]}
{"id": "f8d0e9fcc5a4f2ca386491dca217f73579c5efcae520faefcaf146eeec86e20a", "original": "제법 담이 크군. 처음부터 끝까지 지켜 보고 있었나?", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "胆子倒不小。从头到尾都在旁观吗？", "object_name": "art_ko_flmma21c", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-c86448dee009bfdefa236923310b57ad", "object_id": -6378452956437020465, "path": ["TextList", 23, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 8, "changes", 42, "ops", 22, "value"], "target": "You've got some nerve. Were you watching the whole time?", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Exact Korean reuse; Korean and Chinese context checked for this occurrence."]}
{"id": "ce8275fc3cc9d2ed7ba440c0baab84555ce2e9376b0d5583901d3ab512f99846", "original": "그 자는 내가 놓아 줬습니다, 메디치.", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "是我放走他的，梅迪西。", "object_name": "art_ko_flmma21c", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-c86448dee009bfdefa236923310b57ad", "object_id": -6378452956437020465, "path": ["TextList", 24, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 8, "changes", 42, "ops", 23, "value"], "target": "I let him go, Medici.", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Exact Korean reuse; Korean and Chinese context checked for this occurrence."]}
{"id": "d03589a2a5dca40e90fb103f1e786fc6a6ffced95c431616c273ea090d37a0ab", "original": "클라우제비츠!", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "克劳塞维茨！", "object_name": "art_ko_flmma21c", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-c86448dee009bfdefa236923310b57ad", "object_id": -6378452956437020465, "path": ["TextList", 25, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 8, "changes", 42, "ops", 24, "value"], "target": "Clausewitz!", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Exact Korean reuse; Korean and Chinese context checked for this occurrence."]}
{"id": "6d7b104d48dcc734c046e16b22fb1a9a0ec913a1f972da91f3006201704470a1", "original": "자네 정체가 대체 뭔가?/30d 클라우제비츠라는 이름도 진짜 자네 이름 맞나?", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "你究竟是什么人？/30d克劳塞维茨真的是你的名字吗？", "object_name": "art_ko_flmma21c", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-c86448dee009bfdefa236923310b57ad", "object_id": -6378452956437020465, "path": ["TextList", 26, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 8, "changes", 42, "ops", 25, "value"], "target": "Who are you, really?/30d Is Clausewitz even your real name?", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Exact Korean reuse; Korean and Chinese context checked for this occurrence."]}
{"id": "77745a6331b03fac7f2c7fdaf9bb7ef5c650591d04d2abf97470721b3f6bea61", "original": "대체 당신...", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "你究竟……", "object_name": "art_ko_flmma21c", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-c86448dee009bfdefa236923310b57ad", "object_id": -6378452956437020465, "path": ["TextList", 27, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 8, "changes", 42, "ops", 26, "value"], "target": "Who in the world are you...?", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Exact Korean reuse; Korean and Chinese context checked for this occurrence."]}
{"id": "19fe39ded41ed28fb9f6dcc07c1d732ab5126e213e6cbfb5fe773a14bc728664", "original": "그렇지 않아도 여러분들에게 밝힐 것이 많습니다. 하지만 지금은 저희 할아버지께서 기다리고 계시니 일단 함께 가시죠.", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "我确实有很多事要向各位说明。不过祖父正在等我们，先一起过去吧。", "object_name": "art_ko_flmma21c", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-c86448dee009bfdefa236923310b57ad", "object_id": -6378452956437020465, "path": ["TextList", 29, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 8, "changes", 42, "ops", 27, "value"], "target": "There is much I must explain to you all. But my grandfather is waiting. Please come with me first.", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Exact Korean reuse; Korean and Chinese context checked for this occurrence."]}
{"id": "01ddb166394f3c3871087b6436928e9c13d78e006c6e55237a40cfd99edccb48", "original": "그는 단지 자신의 사상을 통해 체사레와 우리에 대한 평가를 후세에 남기는 것만이 목적일 뿐입니다.", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "他的目的，只是通过自己的思想，将对切萨雷和我们的评价留给后世，仅此而已。", "object_name": "art_ko_flmma21c", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-c86448dee009bfdefa236923310b57ad", "object_id": -6378452956437020465, "path": ["TextList", 30, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 8, "changes", 42, "ops", 28, "value"], "target": "He only wishes to leave his assessment of Cesare and us to posterity, through his own philosophy.", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Exact Korean reuse; Korean and Chinese context checked for this occurrence."]}
{"id": "f9cbb7dab70608d5062f787f745471db00876402fc9cdf20e4c180155e5566f3", "original": "아니 뭐, 그 자가 어떻게 되든 그런 것은 이제 관심 없어. 그 보다는...", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "不，那家伙怎么样，我已经不关心了。我更在意的是……", "object_name": "art_ko_flmma21c", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-c86448dee009bfdefa236923310b57ad", "object_id": -6378452956437020465, "path": ["TextList", 31, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 8, "changes", 42, "ops", 29, "value"], "target": "Well, I don't care what becomes of him anymore. What concerns me is...", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Exact Korean reuse; Korean and Chinese context checked for this occurrence."]}
{"id": "7d3e7a153bfa4d1612e052c110aa5bc23ef79da0d54ac8666addaf9609f9b092", "original": "호호호", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "呵呵呵。", "object_name": "art_ko_fltga02", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-c86448dee009bfdefa236923310b57ad", "object_id": -4502555156983563944, "path": ["TextList", 20, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 8, "changes", 77, "ops", 20, "value"], "target": "Hee hee hee.", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Exact Korean reuse; Korean and Chinese context checked for this occurrence."]}
