{"id": "478bcaaeec557048005a96861e302e8a09513273f759e3ba5b8895d66cea9cc0", "original": "[체사레]/n파괴신의 힘을 얻은 나는/30d 더 이상 인간이 아닌 신!", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "[切萨雷]/n获得破坏神之力的我，/30d已不再是人，而是神！", "object_name": "art_ko_flmma21d", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-c86448dee009bfdefa236923310b57ad", "object_id": 4651266345816920105, "path": ["TextList", 0, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 8, "changes", 258, "ops", 0, "value"], "target": "[Cesare]/nWith the power of the God of Destruction,/30d I am no longer a man, but a god!", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Exact Korean reuse; Korean and Chinese context checked for this occurrence."]}
